  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Happy B-Day to Eric Mayer**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Calling Them Back**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **On Big Holiday**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **MyMorningJacket2011-07-01.flac16** (recommended): FM broadcast; 24 songs; 136 min [1]. Said about its sound: Reviewer says the FM broadcast's audio quality is great [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer notes the listed setlist differs from what was played, since First Light was never performed, so later tracks are mislabeled [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **MyMorningJacket2011-07-01.flac16**: taped by Cindy Hart; transferred by Jon Hart; source: FM > Magnum Dynalab FT-101 Analog Reciever > Sound Devices 722 (24/48) [1]. Also: The FM broadcast FLAC has track splits misplaced: Lay Low and Mahgeetah, plus Steam Engine, are cut mid-song across tracks on disc two [2]",
